  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer planar multilayer coating on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat) (22 coating layers total). Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses independently with bounds ±25 nm around baseline [911.21, 804.98, 703.61, 672.14, 356.02, 1229.24, 356.71, 570.30, 870.84, 635.33, 370.60, 1162.40, 332.44, 462.47, 857.27, 417.97, 831.12, 1275.13, 925.63, 416.00, 805.81, 889.71] nm. Target: maximize transmittance in 3250-3350 nm and 4200-4300 nm bands, minimize transmittance in 2500-3100 nm and 4450-5000 nm bands. Use coherent transfer matrix method. Materials: zns, Al2O3 (Kischkat), substrate CaF2 (Daimon-20). No metal layers. Layer count fixed at 22.",
